  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pernambuco Highway Improvement Program.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Vial del Estado de Pernambuco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM IS INTENDED TO MAINTAIN AND REHABILITATE 963 KM OF ROADS THROUGH SPECIFIC PROGRAMS OF 23 KM AND MULTIPLE WORKS GLOBAL PROGRAM OF 940 KM. THE WORKS ARE DUPLICATION, REHABILITATION AND RESEAL OF ROADS AS WELL AS A SUBPROGRAM TO STRENGTHEN OF THE &quot;DEPARTAMENTO DE ESTRADAS DE PERNANBUCO (DERPE).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
